            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Aimlabs - the World’s #1 aim trainer!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train like the Pros. Improve faster. Win more fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen your aim, master your fundamentals, and get measurably better at the FPS games you love. Aimlabs is a science-backed training platform trusted by over <strong>50 million players</strong> - from complete beginners to professional esports competitors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aimlabs 2.0 brings a significantly <strong>improved training experience</strong> with <strong>faster and smoother performance</strong>, <strong>a streamlined and cleaner UI</strong> packed with more training content, and a better way to<strong> find training for the games you love</strong>. Enjoy<strong> comprehensive results</strong> to track your progress, with more ways to make it yours with new themes and personalization. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This update also brings you a brand new way to train - <strong>Multiplayer Modes</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714010/extras/3963b7d03c12ca5b861f8d2867a6e5ea.poster.avif?t=1794000898\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714010/extras/3963b7d03c12ca5b861f8d2867a6e5ea.webm?t=1794000898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714010/extras/3963b7d03c12ca5b861f8d2867a6e5ea.mp4?t=1794000898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're picking up an FPS for the first time or being hard stuck in a rank, Aimlabs meets you where you are. A <strong>vast library of training tasks</strong> covers every core skill:  tracking, flicking, target switching, and more, with performance analytics that show you exactly where you stand and what to work on next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CORE FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Now Free:</i> Task Tuning!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Training Library</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thousands of scenarios covering every fundamental FPS skill, from precision clicking to dynamic tracking and everything in between.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game-Specific Training</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match your sensitivity and train for over 400 supported titles with tailored routines.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flick Optimizer </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your ideal sensitivity!</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>NEW: Train with Friends</i></strong><i> i</i>n one of these modes</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op:</strong> train any task with friends, plus new tasks built just for playing together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1v1 Duels</strong>: you against one opponent, friend or matchmade.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free-for-All</strong>: four-player chaos in one arena, with high-speed movement and mobility.<br> PvP is still evolving. More maps and modes are coming, shaped directly by your feedback.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Season 2 of The Official Aimlabs</strong> <strong>Benchmark</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ranked across Entry, Intermediate, and Elite tiers. Track your progress and see real improvement over time.</p></li></ul></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>NEW</i> <i>Profiles &amp; Social</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View other players' stats, showcase your own progress, and find people to train with.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creator Studio </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own scenarios or recreate real in-game situations, then practice them on repeat.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playlist Editor</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own playlists, or copy and remix existing playlists to build your perfect training or warm-up routine.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aim Insights</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visualize your performance with heatmaps, trends, and advanced stats that show exactly where you're improving.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ranks &amp; Leaderboards</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete globally, climb the ranks, and prove your skill.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Customization</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Personalize your training with custom environments, weapons, avatars, and more.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mouse &amp; Controller Support</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train your way, on your preferred input.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core Aimlabs experience is completely free. Aimlabs Pro is available for players who want to go even further and improve faster, offering deeper insights and additional training tools.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AIMLABS PRO - PREMIUM FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Newest Pro Features in 2.0</i></strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long-term Strengths + Weaknesses: Your aim changes over time. So do your Strengths and Weaknesses. View your long-term aim trends so you always know what to focus on - across all your collective plays, not just your last one.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sensitivity Finder</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve 49% faster! Find the best sensitivity that works for you and your aiming style, no matter what FPS game or task you are playing.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Training Programs</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Progression System helps you level up faster with daily goals, smart tracking, and skill-based missions. Whether you’re grinding in Valorant , CS2, or Fortnite, you’ll get personalized challenges designed to boost your performance and take your game to the next tier with results you see and feel.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VALORANT Training Center: </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train Fundamental VALORANT mechanics like crosshair placement, angle and peek efficiency, and movement accuracy - all on 1:1 map recreations straight from VALORANT in the VALORANT training center. Use Run-it back to turn all your VALORANT deaths into infinitely replayable Aimlabs tasks, and practice against realistic bots with Deathmatch.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deeper Insights</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go beyond just hits and misses. Break down your raw aim movements and track every underflick/overflick, shaky tracking moment, your reaction time, and more.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptive Difficulty</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The most efficient way to train. It adjusts your difficulty in real-time, ensuring you are always training at the optimal difficulty.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coach Review</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the guesswork out of aim training and FPS improvement. Trained on the world’s leading esports athletes, Coach brings its expertise and guidance to your own gameplay. Use Coach to learn how to improve your raw aim and game sense for any FPS. Coach tracks your aim weaknesses, then suggests training to help you improve those weaknesses.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Masterclasses</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn how to apply your aim training to your favorite FPS games with guided, step-by-step masterclasses hand-crafted by the experts. Get unlimited access to an ever-growing collection of premium lessons across a variety of games.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collaborative Training </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Aimlabs Pro Chat, you're never training alone. Connect and chat instantly with aimers around the world! Ask questions, share tips, compare progress, and get real-time advice from real players!</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get 50% off Shop</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get 50% off everything in the shop, including all Weapon Skins, Avatars, Banners, Titles and Target cosmetics.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get better. Faster.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What players are saying:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >“I’ve ranked up 3 ranks since I started using Aimlabs everyday...”</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - <strong>Someone on Socials</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >“I just love playing Aim Lab. My Wingman shots have definitely improved.&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - <strong> Lululuvely</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >“Aim Lab removed my left-side weakness”</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - <strong>King George</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >“Why go to the gym when you have Aim Lab?” </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - <strong>Aceu</strong>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >“Aim Lab made me get a girlfriend&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - <strong>Someone on Twitter</strong></p>",
